Package: mscc-init-gui
Version: 1.0.14
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Multus SDR / MSCC Linux <local@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-tk, python3-pyaudio, pulseaudio-utils | pipewire-pulse
Recommends: python3-usb, mscc, pipewire-pulse | pulseaudio, alsa-utils
Homepage: https://local/mscc
Description: MSCC Init and Volume GUIs for Raspberry Pi OS
 Includes:
  • MSCC Init — configure CAT/PTT, keyer, PROFICIO-MKII, operator audio,
    fixed digi VirtualA / VirtualB.monitor (writes $HOME/.local/mscc)
  • MSCC Volume — Pulse/PipeWire levels for digi + operator devices;
    sticky levels in volume-levels.conf (restored on mscc start)
 .
 Desktop menus: "MSCC Init" and "MSCC Volume".
 CLI: mscc-init-gui, mscc-volume-gui, mscc-volume-restore.
 Also seeds $HOME/mscc/mscc-volume-gui for the installing user.
 .
 Run as your normal desktop user (not root / not during apt alone).
